            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Caustic Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(alchemical, aura, olfactory)\n\n90 feet. The chromatic ooze emanates noxious chemicals into the environment. A creature that enters the aura or starts its turn within it is sickened 1 unless it succeeds at a 37 Fortitude save. Creatures with the scent ability or a particularly heightened sense of smell are sickened 2, or sickened 1 on a successful Fortitude save. Creatures in the aura can't recover from the sickened condition."
            },
